 the artifact. Activating the artifact completes entry. This screen tracks a simplified implementation checklist, not a machinery simulation.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>ENTRY RULE</span><em>SERVER DEPENDENCIES</em></div><p class="note">Entry order is topologically valid. The simulation also gates each client's checklist on their server entering. Countdown values are flavor estimates only; no real-time timer runs.</p></div></aside></div>`}
